<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to May 7, of 1996/97 shipments, export commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years:</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p>(thousands of tonnes).........................1997/98..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  7,617.6  9,000.0   Dec-Nov	   27.9  8,970.4</p>
<p> Forrage wheat   57.5    170.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a    170.1</p>
<p> Maize	  3,857.5  5,900.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a  5,607.0</p>
<p> Sorghum	  216.7    270.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a    390.2</p>
<p> Soybeans	 239.0    500.0   Apr-Mar	    n/a  1,357.2</p>
<p> Sunseeds	   5.6     15.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a    108.1</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655))</p>
</text>
